{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-02-16 09:51:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.725 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --- BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR)\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.725 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 5, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 15, 2023.'}